"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/book/05"},"children":["第 5 章 · 不要浪费钱"]}]},{"tag":"article","props":{"className":"life-entry-card status-unmarked is-standalone","id":"05-36"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-top"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-entry-number"},"children":["36"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-evidence grade-a"},"children":["证据 A"]}]},{"tag":"h1","props":{"lang":"zh"},"children":["在意食品里加了什么，就买预包装的：散装柜台法律上不要求标配料表"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"lang":"zh","className":"life-entry-summary"},"children":["法律只要求预包装食品标配料表，散装的不要求。散装柜台只要标名称、生产日期、保质期和谁生产的。所以「没写添加剂」不等于「没加」，只等于法律没要求写。在意就买预包装的那一版，配料表和添加剂名称都印在上面。"]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-impact"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["成本"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["不花钱。同样的东西，预包装的通常比散装贵一点。看一眼配料表，几秒钟。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["收益"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["食品安全法第六十七条规定，预包装食品的包装上应当有标签。标签必须标明九项内容。其中第二项是「成分或者配料表」，第七项是「所使用的食品添加剂在国家标准中的通用名称」。第六十八条对散装食品的要求少得多。原文是：食品经营者销售散装食品，应当在散装食品的容器、外包装上标明「食品的名称、生产日期或者生产批号、…"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-actions","aria-label":"标记：在意食品里加了什么，就买预包装的：散装柜台法律上不要求标配料表"},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action done","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"},"children":[]}]},"已做到"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action todo","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-list-todo","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"rect","props":{"x":"3","y":"5","width":"6","height":"6","rx":"1"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m3 17 2 2 4-4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 6h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 12h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 18h8"},"children":[]}]},"加入待做"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action favorite","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-bookmark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m19 21-7-4-7 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16z"},"children":[]}]},"收藏"]}," ",{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"social-share-trigger"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-share2 lucide-share-2","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"5","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"6","cy":"12","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"19","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"8.59","x2":"15.42","y1":"13.51","y2":"17.49"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"15.41","x2":"8.59","y1":"6.51","y2":"10.49"},"children":[]}]},"分享这条建议"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-detail-toggle","aria-expanded":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"10","height":"10","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"currentColor","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},"收起详情"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down rotated","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["成本"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["不花钱。同样的东西，预包装的通常比散装贵一点。看一眼配料表，几秒钟。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["收益"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["食品安全法第六十七条规定，预包装食品的包装上应当有标签。标签必须标明九项内容。其中第二项是「成分或者配料表」，第七项是「所使用的食品添加剂在国家标准中的通用名称」。第六十八条对散装食品的要求少得多。原文是：食品经营者销售散装食品，应当在散装食品的容器、外包装上标明「食品的名称、生产日期或者生产批号、保质期以及生产经营者名称、地址、联系方式等内容」。这一条没有提配料表，也没有提添加剂。冷冻水产品是这个差别最明显的地方。GB 2760—2024 允许在冷冻水产品里用磷酸及磷酸盐做水分保持剂，俗称保水剂。最大使用量是 5.0 g/kg，以磷酸根计。在这个量以内用是合法的。出问题的是超量用和包冰增重。2025 年央视 3·15 晚会曝光虾仁「违规超量添加保水剂（复合磷酸盐）及包冰增重」之后，市场监管部门要求企业「产品标签应明确标注保水剂（如磷酸盐）成分、净含量（扣除冰衣重量）、配料表」（全国，食品安全法 2025 年第三次修正，2025 年 12 月 1 日起施行）"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["来源"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["全国人大常委会 (2025 年第三次修正). 中华人民共和国食品安全法（第六十七、六十八条，2025 年 9 月 12 日公布，2025 年 12 月 1 日施行）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=7b5a76d0461745a08d3f964916b87ef3","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=7b5a76d0461745a08d3f964916b87ef3"]},"；国家卫生健康委员会、国家市场监督管理总局 (2024). 食品安全国家标准 食品添加剂使用标准（GB 2760—2024，附录 A 表 A.1「磷酸及磷酸盐」项下食品分类号 09.02.01 冷冻水产品；A.3 规定表 A.1 列出的食品添加剂按照规定的使用范围和最大使用量使用）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/202403/content_7001729.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/202403/content_7001729.htm"]},"；六安市市场监督管理局 (2025). 关于水产制品及使用保水剂的相关企业提醒告诫函（2025 年 3 月 24 日）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://scjgj.luan.gov.cn/zwzx/tzgg/5414606.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://scjgj.luan.gov.cn/zwzx/tzgg/5414606.html"]},""]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["原书备注"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["「没标」不等于「没加」，只等于法律没要求标。想知道成分，就买预包装的那一版。冻虾仁、冻鱼块这类，预包装上的净含量是扣掉冰衣之后的重量。按它算单价才是真实价格。散装的按标价算，解冻后可能缩掉一大截。保水剂在限量内是合法的，也不是安全问题，别把它当毒。超量添加和包冰增重是钱的问题：你按水产品的价钱买了水。反过来，散装柜台该标的那四样也可能没标。名称、生产日期、保质期、生产经营者的名称地址电话，少一样就违反第六十八条。可以不买，也可以打 12315。你自己开店卖装袋食品时该怎么标，见第 12 节第 9 条（预包装食品标签）。这条的受益人是你自己和家人，属于最高的两档。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["我的备注"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["写下对自己有用的提醒…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/tip/05-35"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["上一条"]},"盲盒、抽卡这类随机销售，按「这笔钱不会回来」算"]}]},{"tag":"a",